Z||000014||cifc||06-29-2001||10:02 AM||||Here's a closeup of the hood.  Sorry I don't have one of the back.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/orange5r.jpg">  <P>It's one of the Warber hoods from Archie.  I've also got an uninstalled Fiero Shop vent kit that I'd be willing to sell.<BR>I plan on lowering it this winter.  I've already got coilovers on the back.  I'm just waiting on a set of spindles for the front.<BR>I doubt if I'll be able to make Fierorama this year.  Had a good time last year, but my wife has a hard time getting any weekends off.  <BR>--Jason  <P>[This message has been edited by cifc (edited 06-29-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by cifc (edited 06-29-2001).]||||reg||1
